about-title = About Glint
about-subtitle = The future of digital fan support
about-mission-title = Our Mission
about-mission-body = Glint was built to close the gap between content creators and their communities. We believe every streamer — big or small — deserves a transparent, instant, and joyful way to receive support from fans.
about-vision-title = Our Vision
about-vision-body = A world where creators can focus entirely on their art, backed by a community that shows up in real time. No hidden fees, no delays — just pure connection.
about-team-title = Built by Creators, for Creators
about-team-body = Our team is made up of avid gamers, streamers, and developers who live the creator life. We build Glint to solve problems we face every day.
about-cta = Start Creating with Glint

faq-title = Frequently Asked Questions
faq-subtitle = Everything you need to know about Glint
faq-q1 = What is Glint?
faq-a1 = Glint is a real-time fan support platform that lets viewers send instant donations to their favorite streamers during live streams.
faq-q2 = How do I receive donations?
faq-a2 = Sign up, connect your profile, and share your unique Glint link with your audience. Donations appear in real time on your stream overlay.
faq-q3 = What payment methods are supported?
faq-a3 = Glint supports multiple payment gateways. You can configure your accepted methods from your Creator Dashboard under Payments.
faq-q4 = Are there any fees?
faq-a4 = Glint takes a small platform fee per transaction to keep the service running. Your dashboard shows all earnings with full transparency.
faq-q5 = How do I add the overlay to my stream?
faq-a5 = Navigate to your dashboard and click "Open Overlay". Copy the URL and add it as a Browser Source in OBS or Streamlabs.
faq-contact = Still have questions?
faq-contact-link = Contact us

privacy-title = Privacy Policy
privacy-subtitle = Last updated: January 2024
privacy-intro = At Glint, your privacy is our priority. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.
privacy-collect-title = What We Collect
privacy-collect-body = We collect information you provide when signing up (name, email), payment transaction data, and usage analytics to improve the platform. We never sell your data to third parties.
privacy-use-title = How We Use Your Data
privacy-use-body = Your data is used exclusively to operate Glint — processing payments, personalizing your experience, and sending service-related notifications.
privacy-security-title = Data Security
privacy-security-body = All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We follow industry-standard security practices and conduct regular audits.
privacy-rights-title = Your Rights
privacy-rights-body = You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting our support team.

terms-title = Terms of Service
terms-subtitle = Last updated: January 2024
terms-intro = By using Glint, you agree to the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.
terms-use-title = Acceptable Use
terms-use-body = You agree to use Glint only for lawful purposes. You may not use the platform to transmit spam, engage in fraud, or violate the rights of others.
terms-content-title = Content Policy
terms-content-body = You are responsible for all content you post or stream through Glint. Content that is illegal, harmful, or violates community standards may result in account suspension.
terms-payments-title = Payments & Fees
terms-payments-body = All donations processed through Glint are subject to our platform fee. Fees are displayed transparently before each transaction.
terms-liability-title = Limitation of Liability
terms-liability-body = Glint is provided "as is". We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the service.
terms-changes-title = Changes to Terms
terms-changes-body = We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of Glint after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
